=== B. CLI-level demonstration transcript (fresh temp state, 2026-11-22) ===
=== T8 fence/repair CLI demonstration (simulated state in t8-faultdemo-ho3u58ii ) ===
1. completed window, status -> 0 COMPLETE_VERIFIED
2. snapshot deleted -> status 7 CHAIN_COMMITTED_SNAPSHOT_MISSING
3. repair-completion -> 0 REPAIRED_SNAPSHOT
   status after repair -> 0 COMPLETE_VERIFIED
4. repair again -> 0 ALREADY_COMPLETE_NOOP
5. collect --once on sealed window -> 8 TERMINAL_WINDOW_REFUSED | repair_hint present: True
6. collect --complete on sealed window -> 8 TERMINAL_WINDOW_REFUSED
7. collect on empty state (no token) -> 4 AUTHORIZATION_REFUSED
8. repair on empty state -> 1 NO_COMMITTED_COMPLETION
9. invariants: records = 1 | snapshot digest stable: True

  note on (7): the fence sits BEFORE the authorization gate but passes
  legal open windows through unchanged — an empty state still reaches the
  existing operator-token gate (exit 4), proving the fence never seals a
  live or future window.

