=== E. TOCTOU posture (T8.2; documented residual risk in review.md) ===
  gate check runs twice (entry + immediately before the cycle) shrinking
  the race to the cycle itself; the read-check-write flow is NOT covered by
  a single cross-process lock (the session lease protects journal sessions
  only, not receipt appends or the gate). Precise risk recorded, not
  claimed away.
